# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and adjust. The Makefile reads it: NAME=value lines, no quotes,
# exported to everything `make` runs.

# The repo `make dev` runs `anfra serve --apps` in: one with Data Apps.
ANFRA_DEV_REPO=../anfra-demo-data

# The sidecars, for an anfra built from source, which embeds none: their binaries (from a release,
# or holistics-core's apps/anfra-node `bash scripts/build-sidecar.sh <out>`), as absolute paths,
# since anfra serve runs from inside ANFRA_DEV_REPO ...
# ANFRA_NODE_BIN=
# ANFRA_CANAL_QUERY_BIN=
# ... or long-running ones to dial, so a Go rebuild does not respawn them.
# ANFRA_NODE_URL=
# ANFRA_CANAL_QUERY_URL=

# Traces from anfra and the anfra-node it spawns, to an OpenTelemetry collector's OTLP/HTTP receiver.
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318
